# Drunken Sailor: traditional sea shanty (text as in 19th-century shanty collections).
{title: Drunken Sailor}
{composer: Traditional (sea shanty)}
{key: Em}
{tempo: 90}
{time: 4/4}
{x_level: 1}
{x_strum: D - D - D - D -}

